{"toolCallId":"call_42459930c61b4c7080b189174d89c1c9","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"---\ntitle: \"Feature Specification: CI workflow efficiency, speed and operator control\"\ndescription: \"Phased packet to cut the CI load of the 33 GitHub Actions workflows, give clones an on/off control, and add a /doctor:ci command and an sk-code-ci standard. Phase 001 is the research; 002-009 are the planned implementation phases.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"ci workflow efficiency phase parent spec\"\n===\n---\ntitle: \"Feature Specification: Open Knowledge Format adoption for system-spec-kit: research, design, implementation\"\ndescription: \"Phased program that studies Google's Open Knowledge Format and decides which of its ideas to adopt in system-spec-kit: frontmatter, indexing, search, provenance and portability.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"open knowledge format\"\n===\n     118 specs/system-speckit/053-ci-workflow-efficiency/goal.md\n     197 specs/system-speckit/053-ci-workflow-efficiency/spec.md\n     315 total\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w4fbf614733/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"fffd25","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
